### =========================================================================
### SpendSync API: 05. Vendor Finance & Reconciliation
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantId = 79ef8bff-1d87-4088-ab87-935989a568d5

### 1. Get Invoice Payment Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor-portal/invoices/{{createdInvoiceId}}/payment-status
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 2. List Available Dynamic Early Pay Offers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor-portal/finance/early-pay-offers
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 3. Accept 2% Early Payment Cash Discount
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor-portal/invoices/{{createdInvoiceId}}/accept-early-discount
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 4. Get Vendor Statement of Accounts (SOA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor-portal/finance/statement-of-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 5. Get Monthly BA-BS Reconciliation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor-portal/finance/reconciliation?year=2026&month=8
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 6. Approve Monthly Reconciliation with SHA-256 Digital Seal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vendor-portal/finance/reconciliation/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 8,
  "notes": "Approved by Vendor Finance Controller",
  "disputed": false
}
